    "text": "If the sum of an infinite <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>GP</mi></math>,&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;and the sum of the squares of its each term is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>150</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the sum of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mmultiscripts><mo>,</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math> is:"
